1
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,260
Have you seen enough?

2
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:46,160
You seem quite satisfied with my body.

3
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:50,060
A pleasant surprise.

4
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:51,430
A pleasant surprise.

5
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:57,300
Did you sneak in just to peep?

6
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,300
I did not.

7
00:01:00,630 --> 00:01:03,030
I was trying to shake off
those watching me.

8
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,530
Paying my respects to the Sect Leader.

9
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,500
Is this how you shake off a tail?

10
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:22,760
After we return,

11
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:25,160
I will teach you how to get rid of them.

12
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,660
Ah,

13
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:32,160
really?

14
00:01:38,229 --> 00:01:40,030
I can finally go to the Cold Pool.

15
00:01:40,030 --> 00:01:41,560
I have tried my absolute best
these past two days

16
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,660
to shake them off.

17
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:51,590
Is there a rabbit in the bushes?

18
00:01:51,660 --> 00:01:52,400
Forget about the rabbit.

19
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,729
Hurry up and find Madam.

20
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:07,230
The Cold Pool is just past
this mountain path.

21
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,860
Oh no.

22
00:02:24,329 --> 00:02:25,329
Ye Qifeng.

23
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,730
If you want to climb a mountain, Madam,

24
00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:30,390
I can take you somewhere else.

25
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,700
It is too dangerous here.

26
00:02:40,630 --> 00:02:41,530
Thank you.

27
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:42,860
What are you doing?

28
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:45,730
Mister.

29
00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:50,329
Sect Leader, it is not what you think.

30
00:02:50,329 --> 00:02:51,790
Listen to my explanation.

31
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:01,760
How strange.

32
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:04,760
He won't listen to Commander Ye's
explanation at all.

33
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,700
He looks very angry.

34
00:03:11,230 --> 00:03:13,560
Is it because I sneaked out on my own?

35
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:15,130
Should I apologize?

36
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:18,130
Um, Mister,

37
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:19,260
I was actually going to...

38
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:21,100
Sister, I came to play with you.

39
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:22,230
Who is it?

40
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,230
Bai.

41
00:03:30,230 --> 00:03:32,130
Why do you look like this?

42
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,829
Everyone says I look like a child,

43
00:03:34,829 --> 00:03:35,960
and that we are not a good match.

44
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,829
So I used my spiritual power
to transform into this.

45
00:03:37,829 --> 00:03:39,030
Isn't it much better?

46
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:43,400
Huh?

47
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:50,700
Sister, I know there is nothing going on

48
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:52,300
between you and this old monster.

49
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:53,900
I want to take you as my wife.

50
00:03:58,660 --> 00:04:00,160
Come, Sister,

51
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:01,360
leave with me.

52
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:21,760
He is too easily angered today.

53
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:28,630
Sect Leader, I...

54
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,760
Sect Leader, I have returned.

55
00:04:47,130 --> 00:04:48,159
Senior Medical Sage,

56
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:49,460
you must be tired from the journey.

57
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:51,060
What did the Kunlun Sect say?

58
00:04:59,330 --> 00:05:00,730
The Kunlun Sect said that

59
00:05:01,030 --> 00:05:01,830
when the Eye of Gods and Demons
was opened a few months ago,

60
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:03,630
a strange object

61
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:05,330
did fall.

62
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:08,690
The direction matches
the location of the Yan Sect.

63
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:13,100
I heard you took in a girl
who fell from the sky.

64
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,300
Yes.

65
00:05:17,030 --> 00:05:19,160
Her identity cannot be confirmed yet.

66
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,690
Even Senior Medical Sage was alarmed.

67
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,330
It seems the news of the one
who fell from the sky

68
00:05:27,330 --> 00:05:29,530
has spread throughout the Demon Realm.

69
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,400
Take me to see her.

70
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,630
If she really is the one

71
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:38,860
who fell from the Void Illusion,

72
00:05:39,860 --> 00:05:42,400
then this matter concerns more than

73
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:44,159
just the Yan Sect.
